      "content": "it's so hard to hear you say that, but it's exactly what i've been thinking. like, if my purpose in life has just become this source of stress for her, then what am i even doing? it feels like the only way to actually be a good mother to her now is to step out of the way completely. if i wasn't even in the picture, she could finally breathe and just be herself again. wouldn't that be the most loving thing i could do for her?",
